{"comment": "alice plays hangman alone with whole-word guesses only: malformed guesses, a word outside the list and a repeated word are refused and cost nothing; six listed words that are never answers each cost one miss, the sixth hangs her, and the finishing push reveals the word, which depends on the random seed."}
